{"translation":{"id":"mal_fbf","name":"മലയാളം സത്യവേദപുസ്തകം 1910 - പരിഷ്കരിച്ച പതിപ്പ്, സമകാലിക ലിപിയിൽ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=mal2015","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=mal2015","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FBF","englishName":"Malayalam 1910  Contemporary Orthography","language":"mal","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"a0a76289883f7cdd3bbbf3947f9880dcd26dd2da7190aa996bdbd83636782aa9","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/mal_fbf/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31098,"languageName":"മലയാളം","languageEnglishName":"Malayalam"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"mal_fbf","name":"സങ്കീർത്തനങ്ങൾ","commonName":"സങ്കീർത്തനങ്ങൾ","title":"സങ്കീർത്തനങ്ങൾ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"ca683e94d67e01339eb22b58396186fb5ddd82f21db831d69875663a11eb5884","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/mal_fbf/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/mal_fbf/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":134,"content":[{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ആരോഹണഗീതം."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"അല്ലയോ, രാത്രികാലങ്ങളിൽ യഹോവയുടെ ആലയത്തിൽ നില്ക്കുന്നവരായി","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"യഹോവയുടെ സകലദാസന്മാരുമായുള്ളോരേ, യഹോവയെ വാഴ്ത്തുവിൻ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"വിശുദ്ധമന്ദിരത്തിങ്കലേക്കു കൈ ഉയർത്തി യഹോവയെ വാഴ്ത്തുവിൻ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ആകാശവും ഭൂമിയും ഉണ്ടാക്കിയ യഹോവ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"സീയോനിൽനിന്നു നിന്നെ അനുഗ്രഹിക്കുമാറാകട്ടെ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/mal_fbf/PSA/134.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/mal_fbf/PSA/135.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/mal_fbf/PSA/133.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":3}